            "type": "game",
            "name": "Kandidatos",
            "steam_appid": 1395560,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395560/extras/d0b4713d66cb3a4daab502c1854115a1.avif?t=1790184259\" width=464 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOTING BEGINS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in the biggest martial arts tournament among Brazilian politicians. The Kandidatura tournament! Choose your Kandidato and win the best !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from more than 10 fictional characters, based on Brazilian electoral candidates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 game modes, including story mode and Multiplayer Online P2P mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Artificial intelligence &quot;Fuzzy&quot; technology where the machine adapts to whoever is playing, knowing how to make decisions according to the skill of each player. Making the game as challenging as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Scenarios based on Brazilian political environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 300 character animations, with audios and unique characteristics of each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And of course, lots of fun and memes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Attention: As much as this game was developed 1 year ago, it is still subject to constant changes, for updates that can add more characters, scenarios and game modes.</i></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395560/extras/d0b4713d66cb3a4daab502c1854115a1.avif?t=1790184259\" width=464 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOTING BEGINS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in the biggest martial arts tournament among Brazilian politicians. The Kandidatura tournament! Choose your Kandidato and win the best !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from more than 10 fictional characters, based on Brazilian electoral candidates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 game modes, including story mode and Multiplayer Online P2P mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Artificial intelligence &quot;Fuzzy&quot; technology where the machine adapts to whoever is playing, knowing how to make decisions according to the skill of each player. Making the game as challenging as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Scenarios based on Brazilian political environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 300 character animations, with audios and unique characteristics of each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And of course, lots of fun and memes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Attention: As much as this game was developed 1 year ago, it is still subject to constant changes, for updates that can add more characters, scenarios and game modes.</i></p>",
            "short_description": "Fight in the biggest political tournament in Brazil.",
            "supported_languages": "Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, English, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
